                    "body": "Judging by the implementation, it is not quite like `:Pick files` as it executes `wt_switch` (i.e. \"work tree switch\") and not opens a file.\r\n\r\nBut even then, I don't really think that 'fossil' is that popular to be built-in (although I personally really admire SQLite and Fossil as projects).",
