                    "body": "> I am not advocating for `fossil`'s inclusion, it's pretty niche, i was just wondering if `tool` could be generalized to \"any executable that gives back a list of items\", but `MiniPick.builtin.cli()` seems to do the job.\r\n\r\nYeah, `cli` picker was designed to be a more universal counter part to \"make `too` in `files` more general\".",
